<title>SPAIN: CYCLING-ROMINGER WINS TIME-TRIAL IN TOUR OF SPAIN.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-ROMINGER WINS TIME-TRIAL IN TOUR OF SPAIN.</headline>
<dateline>SEGOVIA, Spain 1996-09-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tony Rominger of Switzerland won the 21st stage of the Tour of Spain, a 44 km time-trial on Saturday.</p>
<p>Alex Zuelle of Switzerland retained the overall leader's yellow jersey.</p>
</text>
